name 'iterating-with-ai-preassessment-q8_2025'

question 'What is the primary benefit of displaying "active filters" (e.g., showing a bubble that says "Category: Shoes") to a user?'

right 'It allows the user to see and control the logic currently being applied to the data.'
wrong 'It makes the website\'s background colors change.'
wrong 'It prevents the user from clicking on other items in the list.'
wrong 'It is a required security feature for all web apps.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 6

Displaying active filters increases transparency. It allows users to understand why they are seeing a specific subset of data and gives them an easy way to reset or change their view.
MARKDOWN
